# 5. CONTENT CALENDAR — CORE MODULE

Build a fully functional Content Calendar.

This is the most important new module.

The calendar must support three primary views:

1. Monthly View
2. Weekly View
3. List View

Optional: Daily View if it can be implemented without unnecessary complexity.

### Brand Workspace Selector

Provide a prominent brand selector:

- All Brands
- The Professor
- Profacto

When selecting a brand, the calendar should show only that brand's content.

Each brand must have its own independent calendar experience.

The All Brands view should allow the team to see both brands together.

### Calendar Design

Create a clean, modern, interactive calendar.

Each content item should appear as a compact card inside its scheduled date.

Each card should display:

- Content title or topic.
- Brand identifier.
- Platform icon.
- Content type.
- Status indicator.
- Publishing time when available.
- Assigned team member.

Use a consistent color system for content statuses.

