- Edit existing content.
- View content details.
- Change status.
- Change publishing date.
- Assign a team member.
- Duplicate a content item.
- Filter content.
- Search by topic or title.
- Navigate between weeks and months.

If supported by the existing architecture, implement drag-and-drop rescheduling.

When a date changes, persist the update and reflect it in every relevant calendar and planning view.

Never silently overwrite conflicting data.

