# 19. DATA UPDATE & WEEKLY OPERATING PROCEDURE

The application should support a clear weekly working routine.

### Recommended Workflow

MONDAY — Planning
- Review last week's execution.
- Create the upcoming weekly plan.
- Assign responsibilities.
- Set production deadlines.

TUESDAY–WEDNESDAY — Production
- Update content to In Production.
- Add creative references.
- Track progress.

THURSDAY — Editing & Approval
- Move content to Editing.
- Review captions and creative assets.
- Update approved items.

BEFORE PUBLISHING — Scheduling
- Confirm publishing date and time.
- Move approved items to Scheduled.

AFTER PUBLISHING
- Verify publication.
- Add the actual published URL.
- Move status to Published.

WEEKLY REVIEW
- Review completion rates.
- Identify overdue content.
- Review workload.
- Prepare next week's priorities.

This routine should be visible through a small help section inside the application.

Do not hardcode these weekdays into the workflow logic. Make the operating procedure configurable if needed.

